{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates C++ code to Java 8 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following MS C++ code to Java 8 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original MS C++ code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\n#define use_crt_defines\n#define _ert_No_deprecate\n\n#include <iostream>\n#include <cstdio>\n#include <cstring>\n#include <string>\n#include <algorithm>\n#include <cmath>\nusing namespace std;\n\nlong long n, x, y;\n\nlong long GCD(long long a, long long b) {\n    while (b) {\n        long long temp = b;\n        b = a % b;\n        a = temp;\n    }\n    return a;\n}\n\nclass Rational {\npublic:\n    long long num, den;\n    \n    Rational() : num(0), den(1) {}\n    Rational(long long n, long long d) : num(n), den(d) {}\n    \n    void operator-=(const Rational& other) {\n        num = num * other.den - other.num * den;\n        den = den * other.den;\n    }\n    \n    bool operator<(const Rational& other) const {\n        return num * other.den < other.num * den;\n    }\n    \n    void normalize() {\n        long long g = GCD(abs(num), abs(den));\n        if (g != 0) {\n            num /= g;\n            den /= g;\n        }\n        if (den < 0) {\n            num = -num;\n            den = -den;\n        }\n    }\n    \n    void show() const {\n        cout << num << \"/\" << den;\n    }\n};\n\nint main() {\n    cin >> x >> y >> n;\n    \n    Rational target(x, y);\n    Rational minDiff(50, 1);\n    Rational bestRational;\n    \n    for (long long i = 1; i <= n; ++i) {\n        long long q = (target.num * i) / target.den;\n        long long r = (target.num * i) % target.den;\n        \n        if (r > target.den / 2) {\n            q++;\n            r = target.den - r;\n        }\n        \n        Rational diff(r, i * target.den);\n        diff.normalize();\n        \n        if (diff < minDiff) {\n            minDiff = diff;\n            bestRational.num = q;\n            bestRational.den = i;\n        }\n    }\n    \n    bestRational.show();\n    return 0;\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport java.util.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static long n, x, y;\n\n    static long GCD(long a, long b) {\n        while (b != 0) {\n            long temp = b;\n            b = a % b;\n            a = temp;\n        }\n        return a;\n    }\n\n    static class Rational {\n        long num, den;\n\n        Rational() {\n            num = 0;\n            den = 1;\n        }\n\n        Rational(long n, long d) {\n            num = n;\n            den = d;\n        }\n\n        void subtract(Rational other) {\n            num = num * other.den - other.num * den;\n            den = den * other.den;\n        }\n\n        boolean lessThan(Rational other) {\n            return num * other.den < other.num * den;\n        }\n\n        void normalize() {\n            long g = GCD(Math.abs(num), Math.abs(den));\n            if (g != 0) {\n                num /= g;\n                den /= g;\n            }\n            if (den < 0) {\n                num = -num;\n                den = -den;\n            }\n        }\n\n        void show() {\n            System.out.print(num + \"/\" + den);\n        }\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner scanner = new Scanner(System.in);\n        x = scanner.nextLong();\n        y = scanner.nextLong();\n        n = scanner.nextLong();\n\n        Rational target = new Rational(x, y);\n        Rational minDiff = new Rational(50, 1);\n        Rational bestRational = new Rational();\n\n        for (long i = 1; i <= n; ++i) {\n            long q = (target.num * i) / target.den;\n            long r = (target.num * i) % target.den;\n\n            if (r > target.den / 2) {\n                q++;\n                r = target.den - r;\n            }\n\n            Rational diff = new Rational(r, i * target.den);\n            diff.normalize();\n\n            if (diff.lessThan(minDiff)) {\n                minDiff = diff;\n                bestRational.num = q;\n                bestRational.den = i;\n            }\n        }\n\n        bestRational.show();\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.00012313561455812305, -2.50339189733495e-06, -5.960462772236497e-07, -0.00027509720530360937, -1.8000440832111053e-05, -0.007157991174608469, -0.25675901770591736, -0.043014414608478546, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.00013064485392533243, -0.007606353145092726, -0.0019288521725684404, -0.27105948328971863, -0.020564205944538116, -0.27789968252182007, -3.576278118089249e-07, -2.3841855067985307e-07, 0.0, -3.576278118089249e-07, -0.016069423407316208, -2.622600959512056e-06, -1.2278481335670222e-05, -1.2993727978027891e-05, -0.007607772946357727, -1.311301275563892e-06, -1.1086402082582936e-05, -2.3841855067985307e-07, 0.0, -9.179073458653875e-06, 0.0, -5.960462772236497e-07, 0.0, -1.4305104514278355e-06, -0.006101315375417471, 0.0, 0.0, -3.7788631743751466e-05, 0.0, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, -4.577531944960356e-05, -2.50339189733495e-06, -5.960462772236497e-07, 0.0, 0.0, -7.152555099310121e-07, -1.4305104514278355e-06, -3.576278118089249e-07, 0.0, -7.748573807475623e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -1.1920928244